WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.556 --> 00:00:01.546
- Hello Believe Nation.

00:00:01.546 --> 00:00:04.032
I'm Evan Carmichael,
my one word is believe.

00:00:04.032 --> 00:00:05.526
And I believe that entrepreneurs

00:00:05.526 --> 00:00:07.366
are going to solve all of the major

00:00:07.366 --> 00:00:08.999
problems of the world.

00:00:08.999 --> 00:00:10.254
So to help you on your journey,

00:00:10.254 --> 00:00:11.781
today we're going to learn from Chinese

00:00:11.781 --> 00:00:14.003
actor Jet Li and my take on his

00:00:14.003 --> 00:00:16.083
top 10 rules for success.

00:00:16.083 --> 00:00:17.981
Rule number two is my personal favorite.

00:00:17.981 --> 00:00:20.385
And I'd love to know which
one you guys like the best.

00:00:20.385 --> 00:00:22.030
And, as always, guys as you're watching

00:00:22.030 --> 00:00:24.133
if you hear something that
really resonates with you,

00:00:24.133 --> 00:00:25.892
please leave it down
in the comments below.

00:00:25.892 --> 00:00:28.582
Put quotes around it, so
other people can be inspired.

00:00:28.582 --> 00:00:30.813
And when you write it
down, it's much more likely

00:00:30.813 --> 00:00:33.980
to stick, for yourself as well, enjoy.

00:00:37.389 --> 00:00:39.972
(upbeat music)

00:00:53.286 --> 00:00:57.036
(speaks in foreign language)

00:02:06.195 --> 00:02:07.507
- Well always in my life, believed

00:02:07.507 --> 00:02:10.047
the biggest enemy is ourself.

00:02:10.047 --> 00:02:11.415
We need to fight.

00:02:11.415 --> 00:02:13.992
You know, learning special
professional martial arts,

00:02:13.992 --> 00:02:16.449
everybody get a lot of
injuries in the past.

00:02:16.449 --> 00:02:17.913
You need to fight with them.

00:02:17.913 --> 00:02:18.749
- Overcome.

00:02:18.749 --> 00:02:23.253
- Every day, you need to
work, continue to show--

00:02:23.253 --> 00:02:24.353
- [Man] Strength
- strength,

00:02:24.353 --> 00:02:25.745
and do your best.

00:02:25.745 --> 00:02:29.597
So I think the real meaning to Fearless,

00:02:29.597 --> 00:02:34.473
today from Jet Li's head,
is do your best every day.

00:02:34.473 --> 00:02:35.306
- That's your knowledge.

00:02:35.306 --> 00:02:38.117
- That's it, and the
lih-ter is going to come.

00:02:38.117 --> 00:02:39.579
You cannot control, let them go.

00:02:39.579 --> 00:02:41.282
Let them come, it doesn't matter.

00:02:41.282 --> 00:02:43.191
Do your best at everything, everyday.

00:02:43.191 --> 00:02:46.742
Everyday training, work,
everything's good enough.

00:02:46.742 --> 00:02:49.824
If I do something, I do my best.

00:02:49.824 --> 00:02:51.943
I don't know the future but if I really

00:02:51.943 --> 00:02:55.127
want to do, I start, I do my best.

00:02:55.127 --> 00:02:56.159
I'm not Bruce Lee.

00:02:56.159 --> 00:02:58.229
I never can be Bruce Lee.

00:02:58.229 --> 00:03:00.062
He is a different age,

00:03:03.465 --> 00:03:05.882
a different philosophy maybe.

00:03:06.813 --> 00:03:08.790
A lot of things are different.

00:03:08.790 --> 00:03:11.553
Every human being is unique.

00:03:11.553 --> 00:03:13.505
You have your special ability.

00:03:13.505 --> 00:03:16.576
You need to make that become unique.

00:03:16.576 --> 00:03:20.972
If you follow someone, then
always you're the follower.

00:03:20.972 --> 00:03:22.754
You are not a creator.

00:03:22.754 --> 00:03:25.921
I always tell myself, forgot the past.

00:03:27.654 --> 00:03:29.571
What I did on the past.

00:03:31.079 --> 00:03:32.746
I'm a new guy today.

00:03:34.914 --> 00:03:36.656
And every day is new things happen.

00:03:36.656 --> 00:03:37.853
I need to learn English.

00:03:37.853 --> 00:03:41.603
I need to learn things,
learn American style.

00:03:42.821 --> 00:03:47.204
This movie is a success, but
then the next movie maybe not.

00:03:47.204 --> 00:03:48.639
So you need to learn again.

00:03:48.639 --> 00:03:50.806
I'm a new actor every day.

00:03:51.757 --> 00:03:54.344
So this is my philosophy, I need to learn.

00:03:54.344 --> 00:03:57.449
I just normal guy, I play
the different characters.

00:03:57.449 --> 00:03:58.782
Also, I need to learn every day.

00:03:58.782 --> 00:04:02.949
Chinese have world famous
descendants, how to translate?

00:04:04.728 --> 00:04:07.685
When you become older, older,

00:04:07.685 --> 00:04:12.548
you still need to learn, how
to translate that sentence?

00:04:12.548 --> 00:04:14.091
(speaks in foreign language)

00:04:14.091 --> 00:04:14.924
- [Man] That's about right.

00:04:14.924 --> 00:04:16.357
(speaks in foreign language)

00:04:16.357 --> 00:04:18.243
- Yeah, you become older, older, older.

00:04:18.243 --> 00:04:21.552
But you still need to study, study, study.

00:04:21.552 --> 00:04:25.613
Because that's a very good sentence there.

00:04:25.613 --> 00:04:27.258
You need to prove to the world,

00:04:27.258 --> 00:04:29.647
what you can do better than the other.

00:04:29.647 --> 00:04:31.928
So that means you need to find yourself,

00:04:31.928 --> 00:04:34.138
physically and mentally.

00:04:34.138 --> 00:04:36.137
You always need to prove yourself

00:04:36.137 --> 00:04:37.662
even if you do something different.

00:04:37.662 --> 00:04:40.219
and if you can show your talent,

00:04:40.219 --> 00:04:43.111
and you prove, of course,
you have a very good future.

00:04:43.111 --> 00:04:45.552
I really hope all the Asians or all

00:04:45.552 --> 00:04:47.439
the Canadians in the world, they need

00:04:47.439 --> 00:04:49.525
to create their own.

00:04:49.525 --> 00:04:51.311
Even you can learn something special

00:04:51.311 --> 00:04:52.776
from different people.

00:04:52.776 --> 00:04:55.203
But you need to make it yourself.

00:04:55.203 --> 00:04:57.478
Prove yourself, you're the one.

00:04:57.478 --> 00:05:00.163
In China, harder than the States

00:05:00.163 --> 00:05:03.163
because in States, people just like it.

00:05:03.163 --> 00:05:04.589
Then they either have a job,

00:05:04.589 --> 00:05:06.613
they have a family, they
need to go to school,

00:05:06.613 --> 00:05:09.030
and they training, two hours,

00:05:10.862 --> 00:05:12.738
maybe three times a week.

00:05:12.738 --> 00:05:15.905
But in China, lot of students training

00:05:17.262 --> 00:05:18.887
eight hours a day.

00:05:18.887 --> 00:05:21.637
Still training eight hours a day.

00:05:22.537 --> 00:05:25.716
So this is why they work so hard.

00:05:25.716 --> 00:05:28.752
(man speaks in foreign language)

00:05:28.752 --> 00:05:31.825
- I remember once we need to put

00:05:31.825 --> 00:05:35.992
my legs on the wall, just
like that, for four hours.

00:05:36.937 --> 00:05:38.965
(laughs)

00:05:38.965 --> 00:05:41.538
Four hours, and then the teacher is gone.

00:05:41.538 --> 00:05:44.215
We don't know, where is the teacher?

00:05:44.215 --> 00:05:46.632
But we're scared the teacher,

00:05:47.849 --> 00:05:50.662
anytime, maybe he come back.

00:05:50.662 --> 00:05:53.485
So we still keep the leg on the wall.

00:05:53.485 --> 00:05:56.346
For four hours, after four hours,

00:05:56.346 --> 00:05:57.835
that's the whole training.

00:05:57.835 --> 00:06:01.368
Nothing, just one leg, put on the wall.

00:06:01.368 --> 00:06:04.787
After that, we walking like a dog,

00:06:04.787 --> 00:06:06.370
just couldn't walk.

00:06:07.448 --> 00:06:10.781
I think whether you're a success or not,

00:06:11.709 --> 00:06:14.209
you just become happier to do,

00:06:16.596 --> 00:06:19.071
what you really want to do.

00:06:19.071 --> 00:06:21.654
Not for just the name or money.

00:06:24.172 --> 00:06:26.846
You need to do something
you really want to do.

00:06:26.846 --> 00:06:30.873
That feeling is the most important for me.

00:06:30.873 --> 00:06:34.283
Every day, every moment,
I still think about

00:06:34.283 --> 00:06:37.200
how to helping people in the world.

00:06:43.508 --> 00:06:45.925
For myself, I want to promote

00:06:46.806 --> 00:06:50.073
how to help people, it's more important.

00:06:50.073 --> 00:06:54.448
It's like, if I do make
a martial arts movie,

00:06:54.448 --> 00:06:57.761
maybe not so many people
know martial arts.

00:06:57.761 --> 00:06:58.846
What is martial arts?

00:06:58.846 --> 00:07:00.885
What is Kung Fu in China?

00:07:00.885 --> 00:07:04.920
So I'm not an independent
open school to teaching,

00:07:04.920 --> 00:07:07.119
but I'm a promoter of martial arts.

00:07:07.119 --> 00:07:10.758
Just like right now, I promote new ways

00:07:10.758 --> 00:07:14.675
to do NGO and philanthropy
in the 21st Century.

00:07:15.930 --> 00:07:17.694
Everybody can do it.

00:07:17.694 --> 00:07:19.482
When we talk about helping people,

00:07:19.482 --> 00:07:22.480
many, many ways you can do it.

00:07:22.480 --> 00:07:24.531
- [Narrator] The philosophy
behind the foundation

00:07:24.531 --> 00:07:26.445
is that a small donation, made regularly

00:07:26.445 --> 00:07:28.618
by many people, can make a huge difference

00:07:28.618 --> 00:07:30.856
to the lives of millions in need.

00:07:30.856 --> 00:07:32.518
Or as Jet puts it, "If one person

00:07:32.518 --> 00:07:35.405
"donates $1.00 every one month,

00:07:35.405 --> 00:07:38.534
"that adds up to one big happy family."

00:07:38.534 --> 00:07:40.119
- The humans will live in Earth,

00:07:40.119 --> 00:07:41.331
like a big, global family.

00:07:41.331 --> 00:07:43.716
So one foundation, one family.

00:07:43.716 --> 00:07:45.616
Every human being, even we are

00:07:45.616 --> 00:07:48.217
religion different, system different,

00:07:48.217 --> 00:07:49.643
the language is different,
the color different,

00:07:49.643 --> 00:07:51.156
but we're human.

00:07:51.156 --> 00:07:52.680
We need helping each other, not just

00:07:52.680 --> 00:07:54.581
Chinese people helping Chinese.

00:07:54.581 --> 00:07:56.965
We need everybody helping each other.

00:07:56.965 --> 00:07:59.953
- Jet Li is a very private man.

00:07:59.953 --> 00:08:02.453
I think he's hiding something.

00:08:03.463 --> 00:08:07.630
- He's all right, he's been
around a long, long time.

00:08:09.817 --> 00:08:12.028
- Always say, he's so religious.

00:08:12.028 --> 00:08:15.116
The truth is, he love party.

00:08:15.116 --> 00:08:17.616
He go home, drinking, smoking,

00:08:19.303 --> 00:08:22.053
but every morning he feel guilty.

00:08:23.026 --> 00:08:27.193
- Jet Li always talk about
his best movie, Rush Hour.

00:08:28.475 --> 00:08:31.308
Work with superstar, Chris Tucker.

00:08:32.542 --> 00:08:34.419
But I met Chris Tucker,

00:08:34.419 --> 00:08:38.994
he say he really want to
work with me, not Jackie.

00:08:38.994 --> 00:08:42.318
- Jet always compare
himself to Chris Tucker.

00:08:42.318 --> 00:08:47.216
"You know, Chris Tucker is
very big man," he knows.

00:08:47.216 --> 00:08:51.133
- Jet Li really likes
collecting cars, watches.

00:08:52.182 --> 00:08:56.349
You know, the reason, is
because he's really, small.

00:09:00.945 --> 00:09:04.845
- And he demands everybody
call him on the set, hero.

00:09:04.845 --> 00:09:07.231
Hero that, hero that.

00:09:07.231 --> 00:09:10.080
"Would you like a cup of tea, hero?

00:09:10.080 --> 00:09:13.497
"Would you like some foot massage, hero?"

00:09:15.468 --> 00:09:17.783
Oh yeah, another thing, on the set,

00:09:17.783 --> 00:09:20.940
you cannot look him in the eyes.

00:09:20.940 --> 00:09:23.190
He'll fire you, ridiculous.

00:09:24.631 --> 00:09:26.182
- And Jackie he always make jokes,

00:09:26.182 --> 00:09:28.145
you know, everybody make everybody laugh.

00:09:28.145 --> 00:09:30.481
But you know, not everybody laugh.

00:09:30.481 --> 00:09:33.307
If you don't laugh, he fire you.

00:09:33.307 --> 00:09:35.644
- You know, Jet always shave his hair

00:09:35.644 --> 00:09:37.944
to prove he's very tough.

00:09:37.944 --> 00:09:42.581
The truth is, his hair
very dry, sticking out.

00:09:42.581 --> 00:09:44.280
He need to shave.

00:09:44.280 --> 00:09:45.530
- You know why I work on the side?

00:09:45.530 --> 00:09:47.820
He always show his muscle.

00:09:47.820 --> 00:09:51.557
Change the pants to show
he's a powerful man.

00:09:51.557 --> 00:09:54.506
But I'm starting to worry about his hair.

00:09:54.506 --> 00:09:56.382
He start losing hair.

00:09:56.382 --> 00:09:59.782
- I offer him Jackie Chan
product for his hair.

00:09:59.782 --> 00:10:01.433
He refuse to use.

00:10:01.433 --> 00:10:03.958
- Without hair, he's nothing.

00:10:03.958 --> 00:10:08.293
(speaks in foreign language)

00:10:08.293 --> 00:10:11.126
