Much love, I'll see you soon.

00:14:29.852 --> 00:14:31.565
- For the big picture, you can know

00:14:31.565 --> 00:14:34.982
human beings have a 5,000 history, right?

00:14:36.441 --> 00:14:39.700
Everything had to protect peoples.

00:14:39.700 --> 00:14:41.604
A lot of things happened.

00:14:41.604 --> 00:14:43.618
Why we're how hard we try.

00:14:43.618 --> 00:14:47.365
Next 5,000 years still
have a lot of problem.

00:14:47.365 --> 00:14:49.615
Cannot be perfect, perfect, perfect.

00:14:49.615 --> 00:14:52.416
It's not this planet, not this Earth.

00:14:52.416 --> 00:14:54.553
Because we have a lot of cultures,

00:14:54.553 --> 00:14:57.291
a lot of religions, a lot of things,

00:14:57.291 --> 00:15:00.267
lot of disaster, lot of problems.

00:15:00.267 --> 00:15:02.680
Today we face this
problem, 200 years later

00:15:02.680 --> 00:15:04.305
they face another problem.

00:15:04.305 --> 00:15:07.692
The most important we want to share

00:15:07.692 --> 00:15:09.692
is 21st Century beliefs.

00:15:12.577 --> 00:15:14.827
If every human being do a little bit,

00:15:14.827 --> 00:15:16.953
not just earthquakes, a lot of things.

00:15:16.953 --> 00:15:21.292
Education, you know, a lot
of things we can change.

00:15:21.292 --> 00:15:22.953
I think belief is the most important.

00:15:22.953 --> 00:15:24.815
That's why the Harvard professor tell me,

00:15:24.815 --> 00:15:26.828
he say, "I like your idea.

00:15:26.828 --> 00:15:28.305
"I want to study your idea, you know,

00:15:28.305 --> 00:15:30.427
"become a class.

00:15:30.427 --> 00:15:33.778
"Because everybody come to my office,

00:15:33.778 --> 00:15:36.028
"ask, how to get the money.

00:15:39.353 --> 00:15:42.516
"'I need the money, teach
me how to get the money.'

00:15:42.516 --> 00:15:45.143
"So everybody talk about
money, money, money, money."

00:15:45.143 --> 00:15:48.466
But One Foundation is the
first one is not the money,

00:15:48.466 --> 00:15:49.716
it's the heart.

00:15:51.682 --> 00:15:54.777
If you can share the beliefs
to the people's heart,

00:15:54.777 --> 00:15:56.444
he will, he come in.

00:15:57.919 --> 00:16:00.231
More people join the family.

00:16:00.231 --> 00:16:03.291
A thick, very strong foundation.

00:16:03.291 --> 00:16:07.078
Because think about it, in China, in China

00:16:07.078 --> 00:16:08.745
we have a 72 people.

00:16:10.467 --> 00:16:11.704
Even if we have 200 people, how to solve

00:16:11.704 --> 00:16:14.288
a billion people's
problems, it's impossible.

00:16:14.288 --> 00:16:16.339
But if everybody joins this family,

00:16:16.339 --> 00:16:18.006
we can do something.

00:16:19.397 --> 00:16:21.704
- For you it sounds like it's
about selling the belief?

00:16:21.704 --> 00:16:24.678
In the world of six billion people.

00:16:24.678 --> 00:16:27.040
If you can get each one, every one,

00:16:27.040 --> 00:16:29.765
to do something, the impact will be huge.

00:16:29.765 --> 00:16:33.065
- That's why, in the so
far, we did a lot of things.

00:16:33.065 --> 00:16:34.978
A lot of them is because Jet Li's famous?

00:16:34.978 --> 00:16:38.875
No, it's a lot of NGOs
helping us, 70 NGOs.

00:16:38.875 --> 00:16:40.677
A lot of companies,
they don't need a name.

00:16:40.677 --> 00:16:42.502
They just support the One Foundation.

00:16:42.502 --> 00:16:44.389
As the whole foundation moving together

00:16:44.389 --> 00:16:46.877
we go to Sichuan, we have 500 volunteers.

00:16:46.877 --> 00:16:48.076
Where did it come from?

00:16:48.076 --> 00:16:51.217
I don't know, I don't
even know their name.

00:16:51.217 --> 00:16:54.866
They work very hard, harder than Jet Li.

00:16:54.866 --> 00:16:56.790
Jet Li do what?

00:16:56.790 --> 00:16:58.790
Jet Li is just planning.

00:17:01.099 --> 00:17:01.932
They really do something.

00:17:01.932 --> 00:17:03.800
Go through the mail, lot of places.

00:17:03.800 --> 00:17:05.990
It's great things they do.

00:17:05.990 --> 00:17:08.193
I really want to say, the family.

00:17:08.193 --> 00:17:09.839
It's not Jet Li, it's not even foundation.

00:17:09.839 --> 00:17:13.280
The family power is very strong.

00:17:13.280 --> 00:17:16.393
(audience applauds)

00:17:16.393 --> 00:17:18.617
Now remember, two years ago,

00:17:18.617 --> 00:17:20.466
when the Joel Silver offered me to play

00:17:20.466 --> 00:17:23.868
the bad guy, villain in Lethal Weapon 4.

00:17:23.868 --> 00:17:26.618
Then I say, "Oh, I made 25 movies

00:17:27.945 --> 00:17:30.067
"in Hong Kong, I never played the villain.

00:17:30.067 --> 00:17:32.592
"So I don't know if my audience,

00:17:32.592 --> 00:17:35.480
"what's their reaction
when they heard the news."

00:17:35.480 --> 00:17:37.355
So he said, "Don't worry,
here is the good guy."

00:17:37.355 --> 00:17:40.679
He offered another movie, Romeo Must Die.

00:17:40.679 --> 00:17:43.342
So one bad guy, one good guy.

00:17:43.342 --> 00:17:46.468
You can work, you have special skill.

00:17:46.468 --> 00:17:48.882
You can make money for the studio.

00:17:48.882 --> 00:17:50.776
Then in the future, right now,

00:17:50.776 --> 00:17:53.294
maybe better than
before, have a little bit

00:17:53.294 --> 00:17:56.866
of a chance, can choose what kind of story

00:17:56.866 --> 00:17:58.699
I really want to make.

00:17:59.582 --> 00:18:01.632
I hope in the future I have more chance

00:18:01.632 --> 00:18:04.815
to choose what kind of
story I really want to make.

00:18:04.815 --> 00:18:06.958
What kind of story I don't want to make.

00:18:06.958 --> 00:18:10.094
- Hi Jet Li, my name is
Twi and I'm from Australia.

00:18:10.094 --> 00:18:13.603
You say you are very
successful and that's obvious.

00:18:13.603 --> 00:18:17.891
And smiling and optimistic,
and that's fabulous.

00:18:17.891 --> 00:18:19.904
But I believe every successful person

00:18:19.904 --> 00:18:23.051
has failures or experienced
set backs in their life.

00:18:23.051 --> 00:18:24.954
Can you share with us what are some

00:18:24.954 --> 00:18:26.581
of your failures in life?

00:18:26.581 --> 00:18:28.155
And how you overcome this,

00:18:28.155 --> 00:18:30.778
to achieve success in
your life, thank you.

00:18:30.778 --> 00:18:34.528
(speaks in foreign language)

00:20:09.589 --> 00:20:11.930
- "When it comes to setbacks and successes

00:20:11.930 --> 00:20:14.169
"I think they're just normal to me.

00:20:14.169 --> 00:20:16.890
"I would like to look at
it with a peaceful mind.

00:20:16.890 --> 00:20:18.345
"It's just like for your hand.

00:20:18.345 --> 00:20:21.482
"You have palm and you
have back of your palm.

00:20:21.482 --> 00:20:25.132
"So these are two things just being there.

00:20:25.132 --> 00:20:26.943
"If you talk about successful people

00:20:26.943 --> 00:20:29.431
"you can think about the Chinese emperors

00:20:29.431 --> 00:20:31.170
"in the past few hundred years.

00:20:31.170 --> 00:20:32.531
"Are they successful?

00:20:32.531 --> 00:20:34.094
"I don't even remember some of the names

00:20:34.094 --> 00:20:36.195
"of these emperors.

00:20:36.195 --> 00:20:38.280
"So when it comes to success, it really

00:20:38.280 --> 00:20:41.133
"depends on definition of success.

00:20:41.133 --> 00:20:44.781
"And in different times, people
defined success differently.

00:20:44.781 --> 00:20:48.320
"And for me, it's like,
success to me is like,

00:20:48.320 --> 00:20:51.820
"every day I have to live it meaningfully.

00:20:54.053 --> 00:20:56.720
"I don't want to do something bad.

00:20:59.342 --> 00:21:01.257
"And when I die I should be able

00:21:01.257 --> 00:21:05.495
"to face my ancestors,
my teachers, my parents.

00:21:05.495 --> 00:21:08.369
"So I don't really know when I'll die.

00:21:08.369 --> 00:21:10.495
"So that's the reason I have to make use

00:21:10.495 --> 00:21:13.045
"of every day, when I'm leaving here,

00:21:13.045 --> 00:21:14.370
"to do something.

00:21:14.370 --> 00:21:17.069
"I can't say I will wait until I retire

00:21:17.069 --> 00:21:19.732
"to do something for philanthropy.

00:21:19.732 --> 00:21:21.231
"No, it's not that.

00:21:21.231 --> 00:21:23.953
"And good things, bad
things, they're just normal.

00:21:23.953 --> 00:21:25.544
"They're just common things to me,

00:21:25.544 --> 00:21:28.367
"like stocks if they go up, last year,

00:21:28.367 --> 00:21:30.294
"it's normal to me.

00:21:30.294 --> 00:21:32.344
"Last year, it goes down, it goes down.

00:21:32.344 --> 00:21:35.437
"And this year it goes up,
it's all normal to me."

